# =====================================================
# Email Configuration (Required for Email Functionality)
# =====================================================
# Uses Nodemailer with Gmail - works from any domain!
# No domain restrictions like EmailJS
# =====================================================
# Get these from Gmail:
# 1. EMAIL_USER: Your Gmail address (e.g., totosbureau@gmail.com)
# 2. EMAIL_PASS: Gmail App Password (NOT your regular password!)
#    - Go to: Google Account → Security → 2-Step Verification → App Passwords
#    - Generate an app password for "Mail"
#    - Use that 16-character password here
# =====================================================
EMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-gmail-app-password

